#
# NOTE ON PROVENANCE — READ BEFORE USE
# This file uses the AlphaFold-database mmCIF layout (per-residue pLDDT in
# _atom_site.B_iso_or_equiv, ma_qa_metric records) for tooling compatibility.
# It was NOT produced by AlphaFold. Coordinates are from a Boltz-2 co-folded
# complex of this peptide with the human delta-opioid receptor (OPRD1); the
# peptide chain was excised from that complex and renumbered from 1.
# The pLDDT values are Boltz-2 confidences for the peptide IN THE RECEPTOR-BOUND
# COMPLEX. They do not describe a free solution structure, and a free-peptide
# prediction of an unstructured octapeptide would score far lower.
#
_struct.entry_id   MODEL-MetEnk-YGGFM-F1
_struct.title      "Native Met-enkephalin YGGFM, delta-opioid-receptor-bound conformation (Boltz-2)"
